stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> FILES_UPLOADED: files accepted
    FILES_UPLOADED --> QUEUED: process requested
    QUEUED --> PROCESSING: worker starts
    PROCESSING --> AWAITING_REVIEW: REVIEW items exist
    PROCESSING --> COMPLETED: no REVIEW items
    PROCESSING --> FAILED: error or timeout
    FAILED --> QUEUED: retry
    AWAITING_REVIEW --> COMPLETED: all reviewed
    COMPLETED --> QUEUED: reinspect
    COMPLETED --> [*]
